"session_datetime":"2023-10-25T20:25:00","session_id":"session_26","session_index":26,"source_sha256":"0c7ea61ab88bf9a8d4f8a51e1d1b783e2914d46e97d9bc1a4f66c5718902e3e1","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":3}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s3","store_snapshot_sha256":"983238fddc77a88ef4ae3d06b50bcfd25a429f497e89c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- On 2023-11-17, after Calvin closed the nature-photo exchange with a photo he shot in a Japanese garden (a bench under a tree with pink flowers), Dave: \"Cool, Calvin! Found an even better spot, with a bench under a tree with pink flowers - so peaceful. A perfect spot to relax and take in the beauty.\" — describing the same bench-under-a-pink-flower-tree scene as \"a spot\" he found, and Calvin: \"That sounds great, Dave! Can't wait to see it.\" [S30T17][S30T18]; Dave then shared it — \"Check it out, Calvin. It's really calming, I think you'll like it.\" — and the two agreed \"We will definitely go there!\" (a plan to visit the spot together; if it is the same Japanese-garden scene Calvin photographed, the two have found a shared favorite, though Calvin's photo is the only image attached to it so far) [S30T19].\n- On 2023-10-29, told Calvin he's been getting into photography recently — he's \"seen some amazing places and taken some great shots\" — and offered to show Calvin them (Calvin: \"Yeah, show me what you got!\") [S27T2][S27T3].\n- Shared two Boston photos with Calvin on 2023-10-29: first, a photo of a city skyline at sunset with a clock tower — \"Look at this magnificent sunset I captured on camera. It's truly breathtaking to witness such beautiful sunsets! The sky looks like it's on fire!\" (Calvin: \"Wow, that view looks awesome!\") [S27T4][S27T5]; second, a photo of the clock tower in the city with buildings around it, which he took last month (~September 2023) — \"got a great shot - it was stunning!\" (Calvin: \"Wow, that pic is amazing!\") [S27T6].\n- When Calvin recognized the clock tower (\"In your last photo, is that the clock tower?\"), Dave confirmed it is the clock tower — he snapped it at sunset and the colors were stunning [S27T7][S27T8].\n- On 2023-10-29, said photography helps him capture and appreciate the beauty of nature — \"It's been an awesome creative outlet and I'm loving it.\" (his appreciation of nature echoes his park walks — see ## Parks; Calvin: \"You're so talented, Dave!\", to which Dave said \"Thanks, Calvin! Your kind words mean a lot.\") (Calvin's side in the Music and Relationships sections of /memories/calvin.md) [S27T8].\n- On 2023-10-25, when Calvin told him he'd enjoyed sightseeing in Boston the day before (2023-10-24), said Boston has \"so much to do\" and mentioned one of his favorites there that is \"great for chilling and admiring nature\" (consistent with his Boston-parks remarks, see above and ## Parks); Calvin: \"I followed your advice and went there, it was so peaceful.\" [S26T2][S26T3].","text_sha256":"1a4bc46a29058bfe30b62f338d4e7e2123fd561ed2456fcc8597ff20e2848d28","timestamp":null},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D21:1"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":82,"line_start":82,"source_locators":["[S21T1]"],"text_sha256":"cc1632c5775a3a914bdc3cee9d201c3dc5a9c3d8a3f3ec02f3a93fdd8f53fba8"},{"dia_ids":["D26:1","D26:3"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":83,"line_start":83,"source_locators":["[S26T1]","[S26T3]"],"text_sha256":"79b3776e61ca7b37dd8cd133a01deea44d97825a07fddfa0948847955b21856a"},{"dia_ids":["D27:5","D27:7"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":84,"line_start":84,"source_locators":["[S27T5]","[S27T7]"],"text_sha256":"a626a5324d7cd8c327bbaf3b19376126536d7a9256b721119cd2da55c3ca2938"},{"dia_ids":["D29:1"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":85,"line_start":85,"source_locators":["[S29T1]"],"text_sha256":"d6b8a2d90be57bc9ba248ba8a8ca53948f35cce20fd50c4d041fedc12e613f54"},{"dia_ids":["D30:2"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":86,"line_start":86,"source_locat